cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use recheck in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "recheck: The trustworthy ReDoS checker"
abstract: >-
  recheck is a ReDoS (regular expression denial of service) checker. It combines
  automata-based static analysis with fuzzing to detect regular expressions whose
  matching time grows super-linearly, reports the matching time complexity
  together with an attack string, and can be used as a library or as a
  command-line tool.
authors:
  - family-names: Fujinami
    given-names: Hiroya
    alias: MakeNowJust
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-0794-5743
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23660268
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/makenowjust-labs/recheck
url: https://makenowjust-labs.github.io/recheck/
keywords:
  - ReDoS
  - regular expression
  - static analysis
  - fuzzing
  - security
